---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getLatestRelease } from '../lib/release';

const release = await getLatestRelease();
---

<BaseLayout
  title="更新日志 (Changelog) | ORhythm —— 街机与多平台音游查分工具"
  description="ORhythm 历史版本演进与最新发布说明。了解包名迁移、手机网桥手环直连、推分计算器等最新功能变更。"
  currentNav="changelog"
>
  <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 lg:py-16 space-y-12">
    
    <!-- 顶部标题 -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-medium bg-[#4fd6ff]/10 text-[#4fd6ff] border border-[#4fd6ff]/25">
        Release Notes
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
        版本更新日志
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-400">
        持续迭代，精细打磨音游玩家出勤每处交互细节。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 时间线列表 -->
    <div class="space-y-8 relative before:absolute before:inset-0 before:left-3 sm:before:left-4 before:w-0.5 before:bg-white/10">
      
      <!-- v0.1.3 (最新稳定版) -->
      <div class="relative pl-8 sm:pl-10 space-y-3">
        <div class="absolute left-1.5 sm:left-2.5 -translate-x-1/2 top-1.5 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#4fd6ff] ring-4 ring-[#4fd6ff]/20"></div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#0f1629]/95 border border-[#4fd6ff]/40 shadow-xl shadow-cyan-950/20 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-3 border-b border-white/10">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-mono" data-release-version>v{release.version}</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold bg-[#4fd6ff] text-[#070b16]">
                最新稳定版
              </span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 tabular-nums" data-release-date>{release.releaseDate}</span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#070b16] border border-rose-500/30 text-rose-300 text-xs font-medium">
              重要注意：自本版本起 Android 包名正式迁移至 <code class="font-mono text-white">com.nowmes.orhythm</code>，安装过旧版的玩家须先卸载旧版再安装，避免桌面出现双图标。
            </div>

            <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc list-inside text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
              <li><strong class="text-white">手机网桥 (Phone Bridge)</strong>：红米手表系列（如 RW5）、小米手环 Pro 系列设备全面支持经手机 App 蓝牙中转直连查分；</li>
              <li><strong class="text-white">推分计算器</strong>：新增目标定数与达成率缺口逆向推导，智能推荐冲分乐曲；</li>
              <li><strong class="text-white">视觉与排版升级</strong>：数字全面启用 tabular-nums 等宽对齐，新增官方难度语义胶囊配色；</li>
              <li><strong class="text-white">离线曲库增强</strong>：地下机厅弱网环境下定数表与历史成绩离线缓存稳定性大幅强化。</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- v0.1.2 -->
      <div class="relative pl-8 sm:pl-10 space-y-3">
        <div class="absolute left-1.5 sm:left-2.5 -translate-x-1/2 top-1.5 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-slate-700 ring-4 ring-[#070b16]"></div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#0f1629]/70 border border-white/10 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-3 border-b border-white/5">
            <span class="text-base font-bold text-slate-200 font-mono">v0.1.2</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 tabular-nums">2026-10-24</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">
            <li>新增中二节奏 (CHUNITHM) Rating 与 OVER POWER 达成分析；</li>
            <li>优化落雪查分器凭证授权与后台静默刷新逻辑；</li>
            <li>修复手表端翻页长列表可能造成的掉帧问题。</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- v0.1.1 -->
      <div class="relative pl-8 sm:pl-10 space-y-3">
        <div class="absolute left-1.5 sm:left-2.5 -translate-x-1/2 top-1.5 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-slate-700 ring-4 ring-[#070b16]"></div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#0f1629]/70 border border-white/10 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-3 border-b border-white/5">
            <span class="text-base font-bold text-slate-200 font-mono">v0.1.1</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 tabular-nums">2026-10-15</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">
            <li>首次接入舞萌 DX DX Rating 官方计算模型（Best 35 + New 15）；</li>
            <li>支持导出单曲成绩长图与社交分享卡片；</li>
            <li>首个支持小米 Vela 快应用（.rpk）生态测试包发布。</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- v0.1.0 -->
      <div class="relative pl-8 sm:pl-10 space-y-3">
        <div class="absolute left-1.5 sm:left-2.5 -translate-x-1/2 top-1.5 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-slate-700 ring-4 ring-[#070b16]"></div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#0f1629]/70 border border-white/10 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-3 border-b border-white/5">
            <span class="text-base font-bold text-slate-200 font-mono">v0.1.0</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 tabular-nums">2026-10-05</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">
            <li>ORhythm 初始首发内测版，提供基础定数速查与离线机台登录二维码。</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
